{"type": "result", "subtype": "success", "is_error": false, "num_turns": 6, "result": "Two services call NotificationsAPI directly and would stop getting their messages delivered: **BillingService** and **PaymentsService**.\n\n**How they depend on the Redis instance:**\n- **BillingService** \u2192 CALLS \u2192 **NotificationsAPI**\n- **PaymentsService** \u2192 CALLS \u2192 **NotificationsAPI**\n- **NotificationsAPI** is exposed by **NotificationsService**, which \u2192 STORES \u2192 **NotificationsRedisInstance**\n\nNotificationsService has only one recorded dependency, and it's the NotificationsRedisInstance. The graph shows no fallback store or replica. So if that Redis instance is lost, NotificationsService can't store messages and the NotificationsAPI can't deliver anything for its callers.\n\n**Configuration involved:** **RETRY_ATTEMPTS** configures NotificationsService: three attempts with a 250ms backoff. This only covers short failures. If Redis is gone for good, the retries run out in well under a second and delivery still fails.\n\n**Limits of this answer:**\n- I only looked one hop out, at the services that call the API directly. Services that reach notifications indirectly through BillingService or PaymentsService would also be affected, but I didn't list them.\n- The graph doesn't say whether BillingService or PaymentsService queue messages on their own side or degrade gracefully. If they did, that wouldn't show up here.", "usage": {"input_tokens": 8, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 3430, "cache_read_input_tokens": 14993, "output_tokens": 967, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 139}, "server_tool_use": {"web_search_requests": 0, "web_fetch_requests": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 3430, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "inference_geo": "global", "iterations": [{"input_tokens": 2, "output_tokens": 526, "cache_read_input_tokens": 4632, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 456, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 456}, "type": "message"}], "speed": "standard", "fallback_credit": null}, "duration_ms": 25387, "total_cost_usd": 0.049810600000000003}
